The bug was caused by the failure to properly handle and log `IOException` during split shard operations in the `DirectUpdateHandler2` class. When an `IOException` occurred, the exception was caught but not logged or rethrown, leading to silent failures that made it difficult to diagnose issues related to shard splitting.

